vehiclesearch":false,"comparevehicles":[],"latestElectricScooter":[],"latestElectricBike":[],"latestElectricCar":[],"commercialVehicles":[],"faqList":[],"latestReviews":[],"blogdata":[],"statedata":[],"stateloading":true,"sponserproducts":[],"sponserproductsloading":true,"backgroundBannerImages":[],"popularimages":[],"popularImagesLoading":true,"filterData":{"page":1,"limit":9},"filterDataLoading":true},"vehicle":{"vehicleDetails":{"_id":"6a183bb4ac1cbb6883377af3","vehicleLabels":[{"labelName":"New","color":"#008000","description":""}],"title":"Tiago EV Pure + 19 kWh","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eTata Tiago EV Pure+ 19.2 kWh\u003c/strong\u003e strikes the perfect balance between affordability and premium technology, positioning itself as a highly attractive electric hatchback for modern urban commuters. Priced competitively at ₹8.49 Lakh (ex-showroom), this variant significantly elevates the daily driving experience by adding a host of tech-forward upgrades over the base model. Buyers seeking a smart, zero-emission city car will appreciate the Pure+ trim for its enhanced connectivity and driver conveniences, making everyday journeys more engaging without sacrificing the compact, traffic-friendly footprint that the Tiago nameplate is renowned for.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAt the core of its performance, this variant features a highly efficient 19.2 kWh battery pack that generates 61 BHP and 110 Nm of torque, delivering a certified MIDC range of 226 km on a single charge. The heavily optimized charging architecture is a major highlight, allowing the electric hatchback to juice up from 10% to 80% in just 35 minutes via a 30kW DC fast charger. For buyers exploring flexible payment avenues, the vehicle is available alongside the innovative Battery-as-a-Service (BaaS) financial structure at an EMI of ₹2.6 per km. Under this BaaS model, the customer completely owns both the vehicle and the battery from day one; it serves purely as a financial EMI structure to lower the initial acquisition barrier, providing full ownership and absolute peace of mind.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIn terms of equipment and safety, the Tiago EV Pure+ 19.2 kWh leaves no stone unturned. The upgraded cabin boasts a premium 8-inch touchscreen infotainment system with wireless Apple CarPlay and Android Auto, perfectly complemented by a 4-speaker audio setup and intuitive steering-mounted controls. Added practical conveniences include electrically adjustable ORVMs, a 65W USB Type-C fast charger at the front, and a dedicated rear-view camera paired with a rear defogger for effortless parking and visibility. Passenger security remains paramount, with six airbags equipped as standard alongside ABS, EBD, and a Tyre Pressure Monitoring System (TPMS), ensuring this trim delivers top-tier value, connectivity, and uncompromising safety.\u003c/p\u003e","image":["https://cdn.evindia.online/uploads/vehicle_image/2026-05-28-12-05-96-338-Photoroom.png","https://cdn.evindia.online/uploads/vehicle_image/2026-05-28-12-05-97-1200800mainimage-Photoroom.png","https://cdn.evindia.online/uploads/vehicle_image/2026-05-28-12-05-97-335-Photoroom.png","https://cdn.evindia.online/uploads/vehicle_image/2026-05-28-12-05-97-336-Photoroom.png","https://cdn.evindia.online/uploads/vehicle_image/2026-05-28-12-05-98-337-Photoroom.png","https://cdn.evindia.online/uploads/vehicle_image/2026-05-28-12-05-98-339-Photoroom.png"],"location":[{"state":"61e66a792e0f24388ffccac6","cities":[{"city":"649e833b0ae8203a21529fc9"}]},{"state":"61e66a7c2e0f24388ffcce29","cities":[{"city":"649e83ac0ae8203a2152c045"},{"city":"649e83b20ae8203a2152c207"}]},{"state":"61e66a7a2e0f24388ffccc3d","cities":[{"city":"649e83570ae8203a2152a7c9"},{"city":"649e83570ae8203a2152a7dd"},{"city":"649e83580ae8203a2152a811"}]},{"state":"61e66a7c2e0f24388ffcce6e","cities":[{"city":"649e83b60ae8203a2152c32d"},{"city":"649e83c90ae8203a2152c8c7"},{"city":"649e83ca0ae8203a2152c8db"},{"city":"649e83c40ae8203a2152c72b"},